# Skills permitted to exceed their size cap, per ADR 005.
#
# This file is a backlog, not a settings file. Every line is a debt, and adding
# one shows up in a diff so the exception is argued rather than assumed. The
# caps and the tiers live in scripts/token-budget.sh.
#
# Each line is `<skill> <bytes>`. The bytes are measured, never estimated: run
# `make token-report`, and add a line only for a skill the report shows over
# its cap. The bytes are a ratchet: `make lint` fails when a listed skill over
# its cap grows past them. A PR that shrinks a skill lowers its number, and a
# PR that must grow one raises the number in its diff and says why. Delete the
# line when the skill is back under its cap.

